{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2021-02-24 08:30:00', 'title': 'ICE ANNOUNCES UPDATE ON MURBAN CRUDE OIL FUTURES AHEAD OF LAUNCH ON MARCH 29, 2021', 'text': 'ABU DHABI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE:ICE), A LEADING OPERATOR OF GLOBAL EXCHANGES AND CLEARING HOUSES AND PROVIDER OF MORTGAGE TECHNOLOGY, DATA AND LISTINGS SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED AN UPDATE ON MURBAN CRUDE OIL FUTURES. ICE PLANS TO LAUNCH ICE FUTURES ABU DHABI (IFAD), MURBAN CRUDE OIL FUTURES, AND RELATED CASH SETTLED DERIVATIVES AND INTER-COMMODITY SPREADS, ON MARCH 29, 2021, SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVAL. MURBAN FUTURES WILL GO TO PHYSICA'}